OL,5,G1500 Music Matters: How to listen
OL,6,     F1/3. Conductor Sakari Oramo opens
OL,7,     Fa window into the art of attentive
OL,8,     Flistening. Today, Sakari explores
OL,9,     Fthe act of listening itself - what
OL,10,     Fdo we actually hear when we listen
OL,11,     Fto music?
OL,12,G1600 Jazz Record Requests
OL,13,     FAlyn Shipton introduces a
OL,14,     Fselection of your jazz requests,
OL,15,     Ffocusing this week on the music
OL,16,     Fand legacy of tenor saxophonist
OL,17,     FSonny Rollins following his recent
OL,18,     Fpassing.
