OL,5,G1700 The Early Music Show
OL,6,     FHannah French visits trumpeter
OL,7,     FCrispian Steele-Perkins to explore
OL,8,     Fthe vast differences in musical
OL,9,     Fpitch which had an impact on
OL,10,     Fmusic-making through the
OL,11,     Fcenturies.
OL,12,G1800 Choral Evensong
OL,13,     FFrom Portsmouth Cathedral, with
OL,14,     Fmusic by Byrd, Bevan, Gibbons and
OL,15,     FBach.
OL,16,G1900 Sunday Feature: King of the...
OL,17,     F...Beggars - The Music of Billy
OL,18,     FWaters. Paterson Joseph honours
OL,19,     Fthe legacy of Billy Waters:
OL,20,     FBritain's first popular Black
OL,21,     Fmusician.
