OL,5,G1945 Words and Music
OL,6,     FInspired by the American frontier
OL,7,     Fspirit, the call of the West, the
OL,8,     Fstark beauty of the landscape and
OL,9,     Fthe grit of the people who lived
OL,10,     Fthere, from indigenous nations to
OL,11,     Fsettlers.
OL,12,G2100 Sunday Selection
OL,13,     FGuitarist Alexandra Whittingham
OL,14,     Fchooses a selection of music for
OL,15,     FSunday evening, and shines a
OL,16,     Fspotlight on Radio 3 New
OL,17,     FGeneration Artists NOVO Quartet.
